@startuml
title Citizen Submits Collection Request

actor Citizen
participant "Web Frontend" as Web
participant "Request Service" as Request
participant "Database (PostgreSQL)" as Database
participant "Notification & Reporting Service" as Notifications

Citizen -> Web: Enter request details\n(location, waste type, estimated quantity,\noptional photo)
Web -> Request: POST /api/v1/requests\nRequest fields; photo if provided
activate Request
Request -> Request: Validate required request data

alt Location is missing
    Request --> Web: HTTP 422 (validation error)
    Web --> Citizen: Display validation error
else Required request data is present
    Request -> Request: Assign priority (SCW-F-011)
    note right of Request
      Priority is assigned from waste type
      and request age: High, Medium, or Low.
    end note
    Request -> Database: Save request; associate optional photo if provided
    Request -> Notifications: Trigger status-change notification\n(Submitted; SCW-F-050)
    Request --> Web: HTTP 201 (request accepted)
    Web --> Citizen: Display submission result
end

deactivate Request

note over Web,Request
  The optional photo's representation and transfer mechanism
  are not specified by the project documents.
end note
@enduml
